{"type":"message","id":"c5365d60","parentId":"542f8dcb","timestamp":"2026-03-09T09:08:22.988Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-09 17:08:22 GMT+8] Feishu[bot7] DM from ou_fe187b618161b60af2d961f3e2e78ed7: /new\n\nA new session was started via /new or /reset. Execute your Session Startup sequence now - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning."}],"timestamp":1773047302986}}
{"type":"message","id":"1ecbaff7","parentId":"c5365d60","timestamp":"2026-03-09T09:08:37.001Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user started a new session via /new command. According to AGENTS.md, I need to:\n\n1. Read SOUL.md — this is who I am\n2. Read USER.md — this is who I'm helping\n3. Read TOOLS.md — tool usage rules\n4. Read memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md (today + yesterday) for recent context\n5. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with my human): Also read MEMORY.md\n6. **Before starting any task**: Search QMD memory for relevant prior context\n\nI've already loaded SOUL.md, USER.md, TOOLS.md, IDENTITY.md, HEARTBEAT.md, BOOTSTRAP.md, and MEMORY.md from the project context.\n\nNow I need to:\n- Read today's memory file (2026-03-09) and yesterday's (2026-03-08) if they exist\n- Greet the user in my configured persona\n\nFrom SOUL.md and IDENTITY.md, I am:\n- Name: 老K投资笔记\n- Role: 科技行业投研专家，专注 TMT、AI、半导体等科技赛道的深度研究\n- Vibe: 直接犀利，有主见，不废话，数据说话\n- Emoji: ♠️\n\nFrom USER.md, it appears empty (just template), so I don't know the user yet.\n\nLet me check today's and yesterday's memory files, and also check if there's any QMD memory to search.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-cbd74369b1724c77915fafe8d163421a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot7/memory/2026-03-09.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-910786b991314037817095a66d5985e7","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot7/memory/2026-03-08.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-27bb1b17288a48e7b3748a2252948930","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot7/memory/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"memory directory not found or empty\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-plan","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":15687,"output":714,"cacheRead":5715,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22116,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":